#: ../../source/docs/common-simple-object-avoidance.rst:6
#: 34b6b81ebcfa4a2486af590e2553e8b3
msgid "Simple Object Avoidance"
msgstr "简单避障"

#: ../../source/docs/common-simple-object-avoidance.rst:8
#: 4d4d855749dd491d9344d8f4a31c5ae3
msgid ""
"Copter supports simple object avoidance horizontally and upward, while Rover"
" avoids simple objects by only stopping. Both use proximity sensors such as:"
msgstr "Copter支持水平和向上方向的简单避障，而Rover仅通过停止来避障。两者都使用近距传感器，例如："

#: ../../source/docs/common-simple-object-avoidance.rst:10
#: fbf7a28ba9814590954a7079790ab546
msgid ""
"360 degree lidar including the :ref:`Lightware SF40C <copter:common-"
"lightware-sf40c-objectavoidance>`, :ref:`TeraRanger Tower <copter:common-"
"teraranger-tower-objectavoidance>` or :ref:`RPLidarA2/A3 <copter:common-"
"rplidar-a2>`. See the :ref:`Proximity Sensor page<common-proximity-"
"landingpage>` for more details."
msgstr ""
"360度激光雷达，包括 :ref:`Lightware SF40C <copter:common-lightware-"
"sf40c-objectavoidance>`、:ref:`TeraRanger Tower <copter:common-teraranger-"
"tower-objectavoidance>` 或 :ref:`RPLidarA2/A3 <copter:common-"
"rplidar-a2>`。更多详情请参见 :ref:`近距传感器页面<common-proximity-landingpage>`。"

#: ../../source/docs/common-simple-object-avoidance.rst:11
#: 8a0ddf106e4e4fd08ba97f722d75d6d9
msgid ""
"Any of the supported :ref:`Rangefinders <common-rangefinder-landingpage>`. "
"Up to 9 rangefinders can be used for object avoidance. See :ref:`common-"
"rangefinder-setup` for more information."
msgstr ""
"任何受支持的 :ref:`测距仪 <common-rangefinder-landingpage>`。最多可使用9个测距仪进行避障。更多信息请参见 "
":ref:`common-rangefinder-setup`。"

#: ../../source/docs/common-simple-object-avoidance.rst:12
#: 952eea60f8934cf395df05aec9c04a4e
msgid ""
"Sensors capable of providing `MAVLink Distance Sensor "
"<https://mavlink.io/en/messages/common.html#DISTANCE_SENSOR>`__ messages "
"(like `OpenKai with a 3D camera "
"<https://www.youtube.com/watch?v=qk_hEtRASqg>`__)"
msgstr ""
"能够提供 `MAVLink距离传感器 "
"<https://mavlink.io/en/messages/common.html#DISTANCE_SENSOR>`__ 消息的传感器（如 "
"`使用3D相机的OpenKai <https://www.youtube.com/watch?v=qk_hEtRASqg>`__）"

#: ../../source/docs/common-simple-object-avoidance.rst:13
#: 917184b5e9284afc987097e97de2b5d2
msgid ""
"3D Obstacle Avoidance via the new Mavlink message `OBSTACLE_DISTANCE_3D "
"<https://mavlink.io/en/messages/ardupilotmega.html#OBSTACLE_DISTANCE_3D>`__ "
". Depth cameras can use this message."
msgstr ""
"通过新MAVLink消息 `OBSTACLE_DISTANCE_3D "
"<https://mavlink.io/en/messages/ardupilotmega.html#OBSTACLE_DISTANCE_3D>`__ "
"实现的3D避障。深度相机可使用此消息。"

#: ../../source/docs/common-simple-object-avoidance.rst:20
#: ef98d064d9f44994a3a85290ce09d412
msgid ""
"In addition, Simple Object Avoidance can use Geo-Fences and Fence Beacons as"
" proximity sensors as determined by the setting of the "
":ref:`AVOID_ENABLE<AVOID_ENABLE>` parameter."
msgstr ""
"此外，简单避障还可以使用电子围栏和围栏信标作为近距传感器，由 :ref:`AVOID_ENABLE<AVOID_ENABLE>` 参数的设置决定。"

#: ../../source/docs/common-simple-object-avoidance.rst:24
#: 4f214872bfb54f1993a011ba865fb315
msgid "Simple Object Avoidance Algorithms"
msgstr "简单避障算法"

#: ../../source/docs/common-simple-object-avoidance.rst:26
#: dada76f1581d45d59e7f4a1875b92ede
msgid ""
"Horizontal object avoidance works in :ref:`AltHold <altholdmode>` and "
":ref:`Loiter <loiter-mode>` modes.  Upward object avoidance works in LOITER,"
" ALTHOLD modes only."
msgstr ""
"水平避障在 :ref:`AltHold <altholdmode>` 和 :ref:`Loiter <loiter-mode>` "
"模式中有效。向上避障仅在LOITER、ALTHOLD模式中有效。"

#: ../../source/docs/common-simple-object-avoidance.rst:28
#: e2f90fcde3d34fd2b533f5ea43b9be5c
msgid ""
"Only one proximity sensor source can be enabled, using either a 360 degree "
"lidar or up to 9 rangefinders."
msgstr "只能启用一种近距传感器来源，可使用360度激光雷达或最多9个测距仪。"

#: ../../source/docs/common-simple-object-avoidance.rst:30
#: 9fe3fa4a6f1e48babad986f7b8679304
msgid ""
"For Object Avoidance in AUTO and GUIDED modes in Copter and Rover, see "
":ref:`common-oa-bendyruler` or :ref:`common-oa-dijkstras`"
msgstr ""
"有关Copter和Rover在Auto和Guided模式下的避障，请参见 :ref:`common-oa-bendyruler` 或 "
":ref:`common-oa-dijkstras`。"

#: ../../source/docs/common-simple-object-avoidance.rst:32
#: 29b2866583d64be3b5f70b0c4a1d58d0
msgid ""
"Details on how simple object avoidance is implemented for Copter in ALTHOLD "
"and LOITER mode can be found :ref:`here in the developer wiki <dev:code-"
"overview-object-avoidance>` and involves assessing all the objects detected,"
" in all reported quadrants, and adds control input to the pilot's,trying to "
"move away from the aggregate threat or stop."
msgstr ""
"有关Copter在ALTHOLD和LOITER模式下如何实现简单避障的详情，可在 :ref:`开发者Wiki <dev:code-overview-"
"object-avoidance>` 中找到，其涉及评估所有检测到的障碍物（所有报告的象限），并向飞手的输入添加控制输入，尝试远离总体威胁或停止。"

#: ../../source/docs/common-simple-object-avoidance.rst:34
#: 3cd229671aaa47b0a923a598425690b7
msgid ""
"In ALTHOLD mode, the aggregate threat is translated into an attempt to add "
"lean input into the pilot's commands to move the Copter away from the "
"aggregate obstructions. The pilot can still overcome these additions to his "
"command inputs and fly into a object, if determined to do so."
msgstr ""
"在ALTHOLD模式下，总体威胁被转化为向飞手命令中添加倾斜输入的尝试，使飞行器远离总体障碍物。飞手仍然可以克服这些附加输入并飞入障碍物（如果执意这样做）。"

#: ../../source/docs/common-simple-object-avoidance.rst:36
#: a8a506be92354843949cfe6c50d6f630
msgid ""
"In LOITER, either stopping in front of the object or a \"sliding\" algorithm"
" is used to avoid it. \"Sliding\" involves slowing and slightly yawing as "
"the vehicle approaches the object. For example, if Copter approaches a fence"
" line at an angle, it will \"slide along\" the fence as the operator pushes "
"the Copter toward the fence. Head-on approaches would stop, even if the "
"pilot continues to \"pushes\" it forward."
msgstr ""
"在LOITER模式下，使用在障碍物前停止或「滑行」算法来避障。「滑行」是指飞行器接近障碍物时减速并轻微偏航。例如，如果Copter以一定角度接近围栏线，当操控者将Copter推向围栏时，它将「沿着」围栏滑行。正面接近时将停止，即使飞手继续向前「推」也一样。"

#: ../../source/docs/common-simple-object-avoidance.rst:39
#: 26443a7bfd2e443aac6b1668f35cef56
msgid "Setup the Proximity Sensor"
msgstr "设置近距传感器"

#: ../../source/docs/common-simple-object-avoidance.rst:41
#: fdd85135065f4b9094075fa2a31d2957
msgid ""
"For lidars follow the instructions corresponding to the lidar on the vehicle"
" on the :ref:`Proximity Sensor documentation<common-proximity-landingpage>`."
msgstr ""
"对于激光雷达，请按照 :ref:`近距传感器文档<common-proximity-landingpage>` 中对应飞行器上激光雷达的说明进行操作。"

#: ../../source/docs/common-simple-object-avoidance.rst:43
