msgid ""
":ref:`TeraRanger Tower/ Tower EVO <common-teraranger-tower-objectavoidance>`"
msgstr ""
":ref:`TeraRanger Tower/Tower EVO <common-teraranger-tower-objectavoidance>`"

#: ../../source/docs/common-simple-object-avoidance.rst:45
#: a87117b1bdaa4f058479e7500e999fe3
msgid ":ref:`RPLidarA2/A3 <common-rplidar-a2>`"
msgstr ":ref:`RPLidarA2/A3 <common-rplidar-a2>`"

#: ../../source/docs/common-simple-object-avoidance.rst:47
#: 1e776537c589411b90d2a8c36bb9d9b8
msgid ""
"For other rangefinders follow the instructions found in there individual "
"setup pages :ref:`here <common-rangefinder-landingpage>`"
msgstr ""
"对于其他测距仪，请按照 :ref:`此处 <common-rangefinder-landingpage>` 各自设置页面中的说明进行操作。"

#: ../../source/docs/common-simple-object-avoidance.rst:49
#: 2beb9cb7318a4cf9824658cdf4ba0dcb
msgid "Be sure to read the :ref:`common-rangefinder-setup` page"
