#: ../../source/docs/common-simple-object-avoidance.rst:53
#: ad0b9bb02e74421493a30956835f7d00
msgid "SAFETY FIRST!"
msgstr "安全第一！"

#: ../../source/docs/common-simple-object-avoidance.rst:55
#: ccf136e042134dafa06aabff76780751
msgid ""
"The avoidance algorithms have been constantly changing. While in most "
"scenarios it will help the user keep the vehicle safe from any obstacles, or"
" fence breaches; due to unknown sensor glitch, or other such problems, "
"avoidance should be swiftly turned off mid-flight (especially while trying "
"for the first time)."
msgstr ""
"避障算法一直在持续更新。虽然在大多数情况下它能帮助用户保护飞行器免受障碍物或围栏越界的影响，但由于传感器故障或其他未知问题，应在飞行中迅速关闭避障（尤其是在首次尝试时）。"

#: ../../source/docs/common-simple-object-avoidance.rst:56
#: 5d6f80a2e2f742619b4d0960a44913dc
msgid ""
"Set any vacant channel of your Transmitter to use RCx_OPTION parameter and "
"set it to 40. For example, if channel 8 switch of your transmitter is "
"vacant, set :ref:`RC8_OPTION<RC8_OPTION>` = 40."
msgstr ""
"将遥控器的任意空闲通道使用RCx_OPTION参数并设置为40。例如，如果遥控器的通道8开关空闲，则设置 "
":ref:`RC8_OPTION<RC8_OPTION>` = 40。"

#: ../../source/docs/common-simple-object-avoidance.rst:57
#: 6fb637c24c324544b63902958b5470fb
msgid ""
"Toggling this switch to HIGH would switch on Proximity based avoidance and "
"vice versa."
msgstr "将此开关拨到HIGH将开启基于近距的避障，反之关闭。"

#: ../../source/docs/common-simple-object-avoidance.rst:61
#: 93c5a50b656c42ae9380ea61359d8cb0
msgid "Configuring Simple Avoidance for Copter in Loiter Mode"
msgstr "在Loiter模式下为Copter配置简单避障"

#: ../../source/docs/common-simple-object-avoidance.rst:62
#: ../../source/docs/common-simple-object-avoidance.rst:73
#: 3c9d59b83eb34b1bb4334624ae068b9d de29096da4dd4368a53b3dc820ae07e2
msgid "Example setup below shown for first proximity sensor:"
msgstr "以下示例为第一个近距传感器的设置："

#: ../../source/docs/common-simple-object-avoidance.rst:64
#: 5b8c007a79d743b99d1fae1fd11fa363
msgid ""
"set :ref:`AVOID_ENABLE <AVOID_ENABLE>` = 7 (\"All\") to use all sources of "
"barrier information including \"Proximity\" sensors"
msgstr ""
"将 :ref:`AVOID_ENABLE <AVOID_ENABLE>` = 7（「All」）设置为使用所有障碍物信息来源，包括「近距」传感器。"

#: ../../source/docs/common-simple-object-avoidance.rst:65
#: c3c2234f620b41b4994b11297c261e5d
msgid ""
"set :ref:`PRX1_TYPE <PRX1_TYPE>` to a 360 deg Lidar type being used or = 4, "
"to enable using a range finders as a \"proximity sensor\""
msgstr ""
"将 :ref:`PRX1_TYPE <PRX1_TYPE>` 设置为正在使用的360度激光雷达类型，或设置为4以启用将测距仪作为「近距传感器」使用。"

#: ../../source/docs/common-simple-object-avoidance.rst:66
#: e914d85f222343c4ae4a1b5a93823249
msgid "in :ref:`Loiter <loiter-mode>`"
msgstr "在 :ref:`Loiter <loiter-mode>` 模式下"

#: ../../source/docs/common-simple-object-avoidance.rst:68
#: c3aeb00e7b3746ffa59318560e9882e5
msgid ""
":ref:`AVOID_MARGIN <AVOID_MARGIN>` controls how many meters from the barrier"
" the vehicle will attempt to stop or try to slide along it"
msgstr ":ref:`AVOID_MARGIN <AVOID_MARGIN>` 控制飞行器将在距障碍物多少米处尝试停止或沿其滑行。"

#: ../../source/docs/common-simple-object-avoidance.rst:69
#: 473a9ea91de448f284ab795f88bb0a34
msgid ""
":ref:`AVOID_BEHAVE <AVOID_BEHAVE>` allows setting whether the vehicle should"
" simply Stop in front of the barrier or Slide around it. This parameter only"
" affects Copter, since Rover always stops."
msgstr ""
":ref:`AVOID_BEHAVE <AVOID_BEHAVE>` "
"允许设置飞行器应在障碍物前简单停止还是绕过它滑行。此参数仅影响Copter，Rover始终停止。"

#: ../../source/docs/common-simple-object-avoidance.rst:72
#: 5e67baff7e0443c38ed586a68695ad83
msgid "Configuring Simple Avoidance for Rover"
msgstr "为Rover配置简单避障"

#: ../../source/docs/common-simple-object-avoidance.rst:75
#: f4784fea66f344569b7be599278ee6c3
msgid ""
"set :ref:`AVOID_ENABLE <AVOID_ENABLE>` = 7 (\"All\") to use all sources of "
"barrier information including \"Proximity\" sensors."
msgstr ""
"将 :ref:`AVOID_ENABLE <AVOID_ENABLE>` = 7（「All」）设置为使用所有障碍物信息来源，包括「近距」传感器。"

#: ../../source/docs/common-simple-object-avoidance.rst:76
#: 7c3d76f79fe34d41bce54f503b3cc37d
msgid ""
"set :ref:`PRX1_TYPE <PRX1_TYPE>` = \"4\" to enable using first range finder "
"as a \"proximity sensor\""
msgstr "将 :ref:`PRX1_TYPE <PRX1_TYPE>` = 「4」以启用将第一个测距仪作为「近距传感器」使用。"

#: ../../source/docs/common-simple-object-avoidance.rst:77
#: 09891b50408f417f8fa5df69af8b9585
msgid ""
"Rover attempts to stop the vehicle before it hits objects in all modes "
"except MANUAL."
msgstr "Rover尝试在所有模式（除MANUAL外）中在飞行器碰到障碍物前停车。"

#: ../../source/docs/common-simple-object-avoidance.rst:80
#: 2e3f8dd76f75478ea80fc50f9fd0ef9b
msgid "\"Stop\" Avoidance"
msgstr "「停止」避障"

#: ../../source/docs/common-simple-object-avoidance.rst:90
#: 626978293daf442290b74bdba6d62974
msgid ""
"Advanced Configuration for Simple Avoidance (Copter/Rover 4.1 and above)"
msgstr "简单避障高级配置（Copter/Rover 4.1及以上）"

#: ../../source/docs/common-simple-object-avoidance.rst:93
#: 73b15dda7c6b4b1f82dc1df06419ea85
msgid "Backing away from obstacles"
msgstr "主动远离障碍物"

#: ../../source/docs/common-simple-object-avoidance.rst:95
#: 72e9c5a09403463ea673d741862e229c
msgid ""
"The vehicle will actively attempt to maintain distance (margin) from "
"obstacles. This means that if an obstacle approaches the vehicle from any "
"direction, and the sensor detects it, the vehicle will back away from the "
"obstacle."
msgstr "飞行器将主动尝试与障碍物保持距离（边距）。这意味着如果障碍物从任何方向接近飞行器，传感器检测到后，飞行器将主动远离障碍物。"

#: ../../source/docs/common-simple-object-avoidance.rst:108
#: 7d348561071044f594b9b9471baffa99
msgid ""
"The speed of this backing away can be controlled via the parameter: "
":ref:`AVOID_BACKUP_SPD <AVOID_BACKUP_SPD>`"
msgstr "远离速度可通过参数 :ref:`AVOID_BACKUP_SPD <AVOID_BACKUP_SPD>` 控制。"

#: ../../source/docs/common-simple-object-avoidance.rst:109
#: 75b14c58a88a49138bb273d4095b253c
msgid ""
"Setting this parameter to zero would disable backing up. Therefore, the "
"vehicle will attempt to stop or slide in front of the obstacle, but never "
"try and maintain a margin from the obstacle if it was to come closer due to "
"any reason."
msgstr "将此参数设置为零将禁用后退功能。因此，飞行器将尝试在障碍物前停止或滑行，但不会在障碍物因任何原因靠近时尝试维持与障碍物的距离。"

#: ../../source/docs/common-simple-object-avoidance.rst:114
#: 4d221ca9c5164422a71e4a45544dfd5f
msgid "Getting smoother avoidance experience"
msgstr "获得更顺畅的避障体验"

#: ../../source/docs/common-simple-object-avoidance.rst:116
#: 6e36fe653258477db3a4a399fac240e9
msgid ""
"Depending on the tuning of the vehicle, current velocity, distance to the "
"obstacle; the user might feel that while avoidance is active, the vehicle "
"response is very \"jerky\" and not smooth."
msgstr "根据飞行器的调参情况、当前速度和与障碍物的距离，用户可能会感到避障激活时飞行器响应非常「抖动」而不平滑。"

#: ../../source/docs/common-simple-object-avoidance.rst:117
#: f4321ba0b2f540698e2dcf2cce0b4047
msgid ""
"In this case, user should reduce the maximum acceleration with which the "
"vehicle would avoid obstacles. See the parameter :ref:`AVOID_ACCEL_MAX "
"<AVOID_ACCEL_MAX>`."
msgstr ""
"在这种情况下，用户应降低飞行器避障时的最大加速度。参见参数 :ref:`AVOID_ACCEL_MAX <AVOID_ACCEL_MAX>`。"

#: ../../source/docs/common-simple-object-avoidance.rst:119
#: 321f9a061b6147e8b155a61801c8a92f
msgid ""
"Setting :ref:`AVOID_ACCEL_MAX <AVOID_ACCEL_MAX>` too low would mean that the"
" response to the obstacle will be very sluggish and the vehicle may not be "
"able to stop in time. Therefore, be careful while pushing this parameter to "
"extremes."
msgstr ""
"将 :ref:`AVOID_ACCEL_MAX <AVOID_ACCEL_MAX>` "
"设置过低意味着对障碍物的响应将非常迟缓，飞行器可能无法及时停止。因此，将此参数推向极端时请谨慎。"

#: ../../source/docs/common-simple-object-avoidance.rst:123
#: 81884e2aaec041319c524a014474a129
msgid "Minimum altitude (Copter only)"
msgstr "最低高度（仅Copter）"

#: ../../source/docs/common-simple-object-avoidance.rst:125
#: d1365ad1b24048ea9ed3ec8db77ea6f6
msgid ""
"If the sensor has a wide field of view, on takeoff and landings it might see"
" the ground below as obstacle and the vehicle might react to it."
msgstr "如果传感器视角较宽，在起飞和降落时可能会将下方地面识别为障碍物，飞行器可能会对此做出反应。"

#: ../../source/docs/common-simple-object-avoidance.rst:126
#: f50c20e246dc433a95bdade310e88ac6
msgid ""
"Set the parameter :ref:`AVOID_ALT_MIN <AVOID_ALT_MIN>` to have a minimum "
"altitude before avoidance is switched on."
msgstr "设置参数 :ref:`AVOID_ALT_MIN <AVOID_ALT_MIN>`，使避障在达到最低高度后才激活。"

#: ../../source/docs/common-simple-object-avoidance.rst:128
#: af1b7941bde444d38b485b45cb5ee033
msgid ""
"This feature requires a valid Downward Facing Rangefinder reading to works"
msgstr "此功能需要有效的朝下测距仪读数才能工作。"

#: ../../source/docs/common-simple-object-avoidance.rst:133
#: c17f706889ae46d3bf3f764be26ef2be
msgid "Configuring Simple Avoidance for Copter in Altitude Hold Mode"
msgstr "在AltHold模式下为Copter配置简单避障"

#: ../../source/docs/common-simple-object-avoidance.rst:135
#: 1c77101c424a41cd98730fa1ebfc5bc7
msgid ""
"While this mode does have the option of avoidance, avoidance in Loiter mode "
"is much more advanced and has more features."
msgstr "虽然此模式确实有避障选项，但Loiter模式下的避障更为先进且功能更多。"

#: ../../source/docs/common-simple-object-avoidance.rst:137
#: 03ceb5333bd64c5fa774081d2b05148e
msgid "in :ref:`AltHold <altholdmode>`"
msgstr "在 :ref:`AltHold <altholdmode>` 模式下"

#: ../../source/docs/common-simple-object-avoidance.rst:139
#: feeca2fa46da4dd190c17eb2615465da
msgid ""
":ref:`AVOID_DIST_MAX <AVOID_DIST_MAX>` controls how far from a barrier the "
"vehicle starts leaning away from the barrier"
msgstr ":ref:`AVOID_DIST_MAX <AVOID_DIST_MAX>` 控制飞行器从多远处开始远离障碍物。"

#: ../../source/docs/common-simple-object-avoidance.rst:140
#: c55f10b9bf0c4923b7b99cb84ba81cf8
msgid ""
":ref:`AVOID_ANGLE_MAX <AVOID_ANGLE_MAX>` controls how far the vehicle will "
"try to lean away from the barrier"
